      "content": "Wait, I'm a bit confused. What do you mean by \"goblins\"? I'm looking for professional guidance on tax compliance and the legal risks of undeclared offshore accounts, not metaphors. Can we stick to the actual tax law and the specific penalties for non-disclosure in the UK and US?",
